 text variable source, format-built buffer target, buffer fstype built
 from a text stem, and a literal options string; every one reaches
 mount(2) (strace: mount("ramfs", "vf_scratch/process-control/scratch_quay",
 "tmpfs", 0, "size=8m") = -1 EPERM). Shape of 'gen leaf process mount
 operand forms', kind 424 (process batch C, 2026-10-05).
