Create a directory called "vf_scratch".
Create a directory called "vf_scratch/process-control".
a text called 'the place' is "vf_scratch/process-control".
Create a directory called "{'the place'}/scratch_quay".
a text called source is "ramfs".
a buffer called target is "{'the place'}/scratch_quay".
a text called 'type stem' is "tmp".
a buffer called 'file system type' is "{'type stem'}fs".
Mount source at target with type 'file system type' with options "size=8m".
On error print "the mount was refused".
Unmount target lazily.
On error print "the lazy unmount was refused".
Remove the directory called target.
